## 🚀 Projects

### 📡 Laser-Based Satellite Communication

MATLAB simulation of a laser communication system where an image is converted into laser pulse trains, transmitted, modulated using External Amplitude Modulation (EAM), and reconstructed at the receiver to demonstrate secure optical data transmission.

---

### 🧠 Gesture-Based Assistive Communication (TinyML + FSK)

A wearable assistive communication system that detects hand gestures using motion sensors and converts them into text or speech output using TinyML and wireless communication.

---

### 🚗 RC Camera Car

A wireless robotic car equipped with a camera for real-time monitoring and remote navigation. The system demonstrates embedded motor control, wireless communication, and mobile robotics.

---
