### 🪖 Smart Safety Helmet

A smart helmet designed to improve rider safety by integrating sensors and embedded systems to monitor conditions such as helmet usage, accident detection, and environmental awareness. The system can provide alerts and safety notifications to enhance rider protection.

Key Features:
- Helmet detection and safety monitoring
- Accident detection system
- Sensor-based environmental monitoring
- Embedded safety alert system

https://github.com/chr3720-alt/SMART-HELMET-USING-ESP32

### 🚦 Automatic Railway Gate System

A Python-based simulation of an automated railway crossing safety system. The program detects an approaching train and automatically triggers gate control logic to close and reopen the crossing, demonstrating how software can be used to design intelligent transportation safety systems.
https://github.com/chr3720-alt/Automatic-Railway-Gate-System
